  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "５トンの　にもつを　もっても\nへいきな　ちからもち　ポケモン。\nはなを　つかって　つちを　ほる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "5톤의 짐을 실어도 문제없는\n힘이 장사인 포켓몬.\n코를 이용해서 땅을 판다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能輕鬆舉起重達５噸的\n貨物的大力士寶可夢。\n會用鼻子挖地。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est assez costaud pour porter\ndes charges de cinq tonnes sans problème.\nIl utilise sa trompe pour creuser le sol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon verfügt über eine Stärke, mit der\nes problemlos fünf Tonnen stemmen kann. Es\nnutzt seinen Rüssel, um in der Erde zu graben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su constitución fornida le permite transportar\nsin inmutarse cargas de 5 toneladas. Utiliza la\ntrompa para excavar la tierra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È un Pokémon molto forte, capace di trasportare\nfacilmente carichi di cinque tonnellate. Usa la\nproboscide per scavare la terra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It digs up the ground with its trunk. It’s also very\nstrong, being able to carry loads of over\nfive tons without any problem at all.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "５トンの　荷物を　もっても\n平気な　力持ち　ポケモン。\n鼻を　使って　土を　掘る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能轻松举起重达５吨的\n货物的大力士宝可梦。\n会用鼻子挖地。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su constitución fornida le permite transportar\nsin inmutarse cargas de 5 toneladas. Utiliza la\ntrompa para excavar la tierra.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ちからしごとなら　おまかせ。\nどうの　からだは　あめで　さび\nあざやかな　みどりに　かわる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "힘쓰는 일에 강하다.\n동으로 된 몸체는 비에 녹슬어\n선명한 녹색으로 변한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擅長需要力氣的工作。\n銅質的身體會因雨水而生鏽，\n轉變成鮮豔的綠色。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les travaux physiques, c’est son affaire.\nSon corps de cuivre rouille sous la pluie\net prend une vive couleur verte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Harte Knochenarbeit kann man problemlos ihm\nüberlassen. Sein Körper aus Kupfer rostet im\nRegen und nimmt eine leuchtend grüne Farbe an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza tareas que requieren de esfuerzo físico,\nes su fuerte. Con la lluvia, su cuerpo de cobre se\noxida y adquiere una tonalidad verde intensa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I lavori pesanti sono il suo pane quotidiano.\nIl suo corpo di rame si ossida con la pioggia\ncolorandosi di un verde intenso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If a job requires serious strength, this Pokémon\nwill excel at it. Its copper body tarnishes in the\nrain, turning a vibrant green color.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "力仕事なら　お任せ。\n銅の　体は　雨で　錆び\n鮮やかな　緑に　変わる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擅长需要力气的工作。\n铜质的身体会因雨水而生锈，\n转变成鲜艳的绿色。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Realiza tareas que requieren de esfuerzo físico,\nes su fuerte. Con la lluvia, su cuerpo de cobre se\noxida y adquiere una tonalidad verde intensa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とがった　はなさきで　かたい　いわをけずりとって　たべる。おんこうで　ひとの　ちからしごとを　てつだう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뾰족한 코끝으로 단단한 바위를 깎아서 먹는다. 온화해서 사람들의 힘쓰는 일을 돕는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尖尖的鼻尖能削斷堅硬的岩石來作為糧食。性情溫馴，會幫助人類做粗重的工作。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’extrémité pointue de sa trompe lui permet de casser les roches dont il se nourrit. Très docile, il aide les êtres humains dans les travaux pénibles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit der scharfen Rüsselspitze schabt es an hartem Gestein und frisst die Bruchstücke. Es ist gutmütig und hilft Menschen bei deren körperlicher Arbeit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Raspa con la trompa puntiaguda las rocas duras para alimentarse de ellas. Es dócil y presta ayuda a los humanos con tareas que requieran fuerza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con la sua proboscide appuntita scava la dura pietra di cui si nutre. Di carattere mite, aiuta gli esseri umani nei lavori pesanti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Using the pointy tip of its trunk, it carves off chunks of hard rocks to eat. It is very docile and helps people with physical labor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尖った　鼻先で　硬い　岩を削り取って　食べる。温厚で　人の　力仕事を　手伝う。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
